### 5. User-Agent Profiles

User-Agent strings were modified to simulate different browser and device identities.

Examples include:

* Default Tor Browser User-Agent
* Firefox Desktop
* Chrome Desktop
* Alternative Device Profiles

This allowed investigation of server-side content adaptation and its impact on traffic fingerprints.

